<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Invicta to raise 35.75 mln rand via issue.</title>
<headline>Invicta to raise 35.75 mln rand via issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invicta Holdings Ltd said on Friday it was issuing 6.5 million new shares at 550 cents each to strengthen its capital base, fund expansion and reduce debt.</p>
<p>The listing is effective from today.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
